scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["description 1 produces item 1 action", "description 10 produces item 10 action", "description 2 produces item 2 action", "description 3 produces item 3 action", "description 4 produces item 4 action", "description 5 produces item 5 action", "description 6 produces item 6 action", "description 7 produces item 7 action", "description 8 produces item 8 action", "description 9 produces item 9 action"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["authorised representatives of 3 rd country manufacturers acts as addressee in item 2 action", "european commission acts as addressee in action 3", "ms applicants for financial schemes acts as addressee in item 7 action", "national market surveillance authorities via ec run eprel database acts as addressee in action 1", "national market surveillance authorities via ec run eprel database acts as addressee in action 2", "providers of online marketplaces acts as addressee in item 6 action", "retailer acts as addressee in item 3 action", "retailers at point of sale acts as addressee in item 4 action", "supplier of energy related product with label authorised representatives acts as addresser in action 1", "suppliers acts as addressee in item 5 action", "suppliers manufacturers authorised representatives of manufacturers outside the eu acts as addressee in item 1 action", "tyre manufacturers acts as addressee in item 10 action", "tyre manufacturers acts as addressee in item 8 action", "tyre manufacturers acts as addressee in item 9 action", "tyre supplier acts as addresser in action 3", "tyre suppliers acts as addresser in action 2"].

